---
_label: "Keyboard shortcuts"
_icon: icon.zap
description: "Keyboard shortcuts built into the Typedown default theme for navigation, search, and appearance."
---

The default theme provides keyboard shortcuts for common actions. On macOS, `Ctrl` can be replaced with `⌘`.

## Navigation

| Shortcut | Action |
| -------- | ------ |
| `Ctrl ←` / `Ctrl →` | Go to the previous or next page |

## Search and commands

| Shortcut | Action |
| -------- | ------ |
| `Ctrl K` | Open search |
| `Ctrl /` | Open command palette |
| `↑` / `↓` | Navigate between results |
| `Enter` | Open selected result |
| `Esc` | Close search or palette |

## Sidebar

| Shortcut | Action |
| -------- | ------ |
| `Ctrl \` | Toggle sidebar |
